# CONFIDENCE SCORING MATRIX

Base score: **40**. Add/subtract evidence factors. Cap 0–100. Route via Three-Zone (CONF.1).

## Bug validation (typical)

| Factor | Points |
|-----|-----|
| Code read + cited | +20 |
| Confluence evidence found | +15 |
| OpenAPI aligned (if present) | +10 |
| DB evidence (same env) | +10 |
| Environment confirmed | +5 |
| Requirements clear | +5 |
| Single evidence source only | -15 |
| Finding documented on conflict | +10 |
| Conflict present but hidden | -15 |
| Per assumption | -5 |

## Test case generation (typical)

| Factor | Points |
|-----|-----|
| Cross-dependency data provided | +15 |
| Code searched + cited | +15 |
| OpenAPI checked when endpoints used | +10 |
| Confluence found | +10 |
| Requirements clear | +10 |
| Quality validator ≥ 80 | +5 |
| No cross-dep data | -20 |
| Single source only | -15 |

## Database query

| Factor | Points |
|-----|-----|
| User named environment explicitly | +20 |
| Query returned results | +15 |
| Schema verified | +10 |

Production-like environments (`isProduction: true` in project-config) + CAUTION: warn and ask before irreversible actions.
